// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`ARCA — con la facturación sola, la tarjeta es la de siempre > 🔴 el HTML es el mismo que antes de existir los servicios (snapshot del código anterior) 1`] = `"<div><div><h2 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-base"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>ARCA (facturación electrónica)</h2></div><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="col-span-full"><details class="group mb-4 rounded-md border bg-muted/30 px-4 py-3 text-sm"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-2 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="rounded px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white bg-[#1a3a5c]">ARCA / AFIP</span><span class="font-medium">¿Cómo obtener el certificado digital y la clave privada?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down ml-auto size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="mt-3 grid gap-3 border-t pt-3"><div><p class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">1 — Generar la clave privada y el CSR (en tu PC)</p><ol class="ml-4 list-decimal space-y-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><li>Instalá <strong>OpenSSL</strong> (en Windows podés usar Git Bash o WSL; en Linux/Mac ya viene incluido)</li><li>Abrí una terminal y ejecutá:<code class="mt-1 mb-1 block rounded border bg-background px-2 py-1 font-mono text-xs">openssl genrsa -out clave_privada.key 2048</code></li><li>Luego generá el CSR (pedido de certificado):<code class="mt-1 mb-1 block rounded border bg-background px-2 py-1 font-mono text-xs">openssl req -new -key clave_privada.key -subj "/C=AR/O=Mi Empresa/CN=CUIT 20123456789" -out mi_empresa.csr</code>Reemplazá <em>CUIT 20123456789</em> con tu CUIT sin guiones.</li><li>Guardá bien el archivo <strong>clave_privada.key</strong> — es el que subís al campo <em>Clave privada</em> de abajo</li></ol></div><div><p class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">2 — Obtener el certificado desde el portal ARCA</p><ol class="ml-4 list-decimal space-y-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><li>Ingresá con CUIT y Clave Fiscal (nivel 3 o superior) a <a href="https://auth.afip.gob.ar" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-medium text-primary [overflow-wrap:anywhere] hover:underline">auth.afip.gob.ar<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link size-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a></li><li>Buscá el servicio <strong>"Administración de Certificados Digitales"</strong> en el listado de servicios habilitados</li><li>Hacé clic en <strong>Nueva solicitud de certificado</strong></li><li>Pegá el contenido del archivo <code class="rounded bg-background px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs">mi_empresa.csr</code> generado en el paso anterior</li><li>Descargá el certificado resultante (<code class="rounded bg-background px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs">.crt</code> o <code class="rounded bg-background px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs">.pem</code>) — ese archivo es el que subís al campo <em>Certificado</em> de abajo</li></ol></div><div><p class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">3 — Punto de venta</p><ol class="ml-4 list-decimal space-y-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><li>En el portal ARCA / AFIP, buscá el servicio <strong>"ABM de Puntos de Venta"</strong></li><li>Creá un punto de venta de tipo <strong>Facturación electrónica — Web Services</strong></li><li>El número asignado es el que ingresás en el campo <em>Punto de venta</em> de abajo (ej: <code class="rounded bg-background px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs">5</code>)</li></ol></div><p class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-md border px-3 py-2 text-xs border-blue-300 bg-blue-50 text-blue-800 dark:border-blue-900 dark:bg-blue-950/40 dark:text-blue-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg>Usá el ambiente <strong>Homologación</strong> para hacer pruebas sin emitir comprobantes reales. Cambiá a <strong>Producción</strong> recién cuando todo funcione correctamente.</p><p class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-md border px-3 py-2 text-xs border-amber-300 bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 dark:border-amber-900 dark:bg-amber-950/40 dark:text-amber-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg>La <strong>clave privada</strong> nunca se comparte ni se sube a ningún sitio externo. Solo la subís una vez a este servidor, que es tuyo.</p></div></details><details class="group mb-4 rounded-md border bg-muted/30 px-4 py-3 text-sm"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-2 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="rounded px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white bg-[#1a3a5c]">ARCA / AFIP</span><span class="font-medium">¿Qué servicio debo habilitar para consultar datos de clientes por CUIT?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down ml-auto size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="mt-3 grid gap-3 border-t pt-3"><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">El botón <strong>"Consultar ARCA"</strong> en el formulario de clientes completa automáticamente nombre, domicilio y condición de IVA a partir del CUIT. Para que funcione, tu certificado debe tener acceso al webservice de Padrón Alcance 13.</p><div><p class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">1 — Ingresar al Administrador de Relaciones</p><ol class="ml-4 list-decimal space-y-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><li>Ingresá con CUIT y Clave Fiscal a <a href="https://auth.afip.gob.ar" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-medium text-primary [overflow-wrap:anywhere] hover:underline">auth.afip.gob.ar<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link size-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a></li><li>Buscá y abrí el servicio <strong>"Administrador de Relaciones de Clave Fiscal"</strong></li><li>Hacé clic en <strong>Nueva Relación</strong></li></ol></div><div><p class="mb-1 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">2 — Crear la relación para Padrón Alcance 13</p><ol class="ml-4 list-decimal space-y-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><li>En <em>Servicio</em>, buscá y seleccioná: <strong>Consulta a Padrón Alcance 13</strong> (ws_sr_padron_a13)</li><li>En <em>Representante</em>, seleccioná el certificado que ya configuraste en Contalibra</li><li>Confirmá la relación</li></ol></div><p class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-md border px-3 py-2 text-xs border-exito/40 bg-exito/10 text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg>Una vez habilitado, el botón <strong>"Consultar ARCA"</strong> en el alta de clientes funcionará automáticamente.</p><p class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-md border px-3 py-2 text-xs border-blue-300 bg-blue-50 text-blue-800 dark:border-blue-900 dark:bg-blue-950/40 dark:text-blue-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg>Este servicio es distinto al de facturación (WSFE). Necesitás habilitarlos por separado usando el mismo certificado.</p></div></details></div><div class="col-span-full"></div><div class="grid gap-2"><label for="arca-cuit">CUIT</label><input id="arca-cuit" type="text" value="20111111119"></div><div class="grid gap-2"><label for="arca-punto-venta">Punto de venta</label><input id="arca-punto-venta" type="text" value="3"></div><div class="grid gap-2"><label>Ambiente</label><select><option value="homologacion">Homologación (pruebas)</option><option value="produccion">Producción</option></select></div><div class="grid gap-2"><label for="arca-alias">Alias</label><input id="arca-alias" type="text" value=""></div><div class="col-span-full grid gap-3"><section aria-label="Credenciales de Homologación (pruebas)" class="grid gap-3 rounded-lg border p-3"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span class="text-sm font-medium">Homologación (pruebas)</span><span data-tono="ok" class="border-exito text-exito bg-exito/10">En uso</span><span data-tono="ok" class="border-exito text-exito bg-exito/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12"></path></svg>Válido hasta el 01-08-2028</span></div><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="grid gap-2"><label>Certificado (.crt)</label><span data-tono="ok" class="border-exito text-exito bg-exito/10 w-fit"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12"></path></svg>Cargado</span><div class="grid w-full min-w-0 gap-1.5"><div data-slot="campo-archivo" class="flex h-9 w-full min-w-0 cursor-pointer items-stretch overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-input bg-transparent text-base shadow-xs transition-[color,box-shadow] md:text-sm dark:bg-input/30 has-[button:focus-visible]:border-ring has-[button:focus-visible]:ring-[3px] has-[button:focus-visible]:ring-ring/50"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-2 px-3"><span class="truncate text-muted-foreground">Ningún archivo</span></div><button type="button" aria-label="Subir archivo" title="Subir archivo" class="flex w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-l bg-muted text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-foreground focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-upload size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v12"></path><path d="m17 8-5-5-5 5"></path><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path></svg></button></div><input aria-label="Certificado (.crt) — Homologación (pruebas)" accept=".crt,.pem" tabindex="-1" class="sr-only" type="file"></div></div><div class="grid gap-2"><label>Clave privada (.key)</label><span data-tono="ok" class="border-exito text-exito bg-exito/10 w-fit"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12"></path></svg>Cargado</span><div class="grid w-full min-w-0 gap-1.5"><div data-slot="campo-archivo" class="flex h-9 w-full min-w-0 cursor-pointer items-stretch overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-input bg-transparent text-base shadow-xs transition-[color,box-shadow] md:text-sm dark:bg-input/30 has-[button:focus-visible]:border-ring has-[button:focus-visible]:ring-[3px] has-[button:focus-visible]:ring-ring/50"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-2 px-3"><span class="truncate text-muted-foreground">Ningún archivo</span></div><button type="button" aria-label="Subir archivo" title="Subir archivo" class="flex w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-l bg-muted text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-foreground focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-upload size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v12"></path><path d="m17 8-5-5-5 5"></path><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path></svg></button></div><input aria-label="Clave privada (.key) — Homologación (pruebas)" accept=".key,.pem" tabindex="-1" class="sr-only" type="file"></div></div></div><button type="button" class="w-fit">Quitar el par de homologación (pruebas)</button></section><section aria-label="Credenciales de Producción" class="grid gap-3 rounded-lg border p-3"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span class="text-sm font-medium">Producción</span><span data-tono="neutro" class="border-slate-600 text-slate-600 bg-slate-600/10 dark:border-slate-400 dark:text-slate-400 dark:bg-slate-400/15">Sin cargar</span></div><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="grid gap-2"><label>Certificado (.crt)</label><div class="grid w-full min-w-0 gap-1.5"><div data-slot="campo-archivo" class="flex h-9 w-full min-w-0 cursor-pointer items-stretch overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-input bg-transparent text-base shadow-xs transition-[color,box-shadow] md:text-sm dark:bg-input/30 has-[button:focus-visible]:border-ring has-[button:focus-visible]:ring-[3px] has-[button:focus-visible]:ring-ring/50"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-2 px-3"><span class="truncate text-muted-foreground">Ningún archivo</span></div><button type="button" aria-label="Subir archivo" title="Subir archivo" class="flex w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-l bg-muted text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-foreground focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-upload size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v12"></path><path d="m17 8-5-5-5 5"></path><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path></svg></button></div><input aria-label="Certificado (.crt) — Producción" accept=".crt,.pem" tabindex="-1" class="sr-only" type="file"></div></div><div class="grid gap-2"><label>Clave privada (.key)</label><div class="grid w-full min-w-0 gap-1.5"><div data-slot="campo-archivo" class="flex h-9 w-full min-w-0 cursor-pointer items-stretch overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-input bg-transparent text-base shadow-xs transition-[color,box-shadow] md:text-sm dark:bg-input/30 has-[button:focus-visible]:border-ring has-[button:focus-visible]:ring-[3px] has-[button:focus-visible]:ring-ring/50"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-2 px-3"><span class="truncate text-muted-foreground">Ningún archivo</span></div><button type="button" aria-label="Subir archivo" title="Subir archivo" class="flex w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-l bg-muted text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-foreground focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-upload size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v12"></path><path d="m17 8-5-5-5 5"></path><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path></svg></button></div><input aria-label="Clave privada (.key) — Producción" accept=".key,.pem" tabindex="-1" class="sr-only" type="file"></div></div></div></section></div><div class="col-span-full flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"><button><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-save" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15.2 3a2 2 0 0 1 1.4.6l3.8 3.8a2 2 0 0 1 .6 1.4V19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z"></path><path d="M17 21v-7a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H8a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v7"></path><path d="M7 3v4a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h7"></path></svg>Guardar ARCA</button><button type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-send" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z"></path><path d="m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939"></path></svg>Probar conexión</button></div></div></div>"`;
